<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Вход</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f2027, #203a43, #2c5364);
      min-height: 100vh;
      color: #e8eef2;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 40px;
      max-width: 420px;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }
    h1 { color: #4fc3f7; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 1.6rem; }
    p { color: #b0bec5; margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.5; }
    code {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      color: #4fc3f7;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      background: #4fc3f7;
      color: #0f2027;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .back {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 18px;
      color: #90a4ae;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>🔐 Требуется доступ</h1>
    <p>Для открытия формы добавления нужен параметр <code>?auth=1</code> в адресе.</p>
    <a href="/add?auth=1" class="btn">Войти как гость</a>
    <a href="/" class="back">← На главную</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>